{"name":"English Breakfast","hex":"#441111","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"english","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Spinning or rotary motion given to a ball around the vertical axis, as in pool, billiards or bowling; spin, sidespin.","An unusual or unexpected interpretation of a text or idea, a spin, a nuance."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["Alternative form of English."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/english"},{"term":"breakfast","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The first meal of the day, usually eaten in the morning.","A meal consisting of food normally eaten in the morning, which may typically include eggs, sausages, toast, bacon, etc."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To eat the morning meal.","To serve breakfast to."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/breakfast"}],"entries":[{"title":"Full breakfast","blocks":[{"text":"A full breakfast or fry-up is a substantial cooked breakfast meal often made in Great Britain and Ireland. Depending on the region where it is served a full breakfast, or one of its variants, may also be referred to as a full English, full Scottish, full Welsh, full Irish fry up, or Ulster fry. Other variants of the full breakfast are made elsewhere."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d2/Full_English_breakfast_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Full_English_breakfast_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Full_breakfast","wikidata":"Q40853306"},{"title":"Breakfast","blocks":[{"text":"Breakfast is the first meal of the day, usually eaten in the morning. The word in English refers to breaking the fasting period of the previous night. Various \"typical\" or \"traditional\" breakfast menus exist, with food choices varying by regions and traditions worldwide."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/75/Breakfast_at_the_Black_Bear_Diner.jpg/330px-Breakfast_at_the_Black_Bear_Diner.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Breakfast","wikidata":"Q80973"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/Floris_Claesz._van_Dyck_001.jpg/500px-Floris_Claesz._van_Dyck_001.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/Floris_Claesz._van_Dyck_001.jpg/1280px-Floris_Claesz._van_Dyck_001.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/Floris_Claesz._van_Dyck_001.jpg/500px-Floris_Claesz._van_Dyck_001.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AFloris_Claesz._van_Dyck_001.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b0/Alex_Cafe%2C_Islington_-_geograph.org.uk_-_453902.jpg/500px-Alex_Cafe%2C_Islington_-_geograph.org.uk_-_453902.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b0/Alex_Cafe%2C_Islington_-_geograph.org.uk_-_453902.jpg/500px-Alex_Cafe%2C_Islington_-_geograph.org.uk_-_453902.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The British cafe (such as this one in Islington, London, with a \"breakfast served all day\" sign) typically serves the full breakfast throughout the day.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAlex_Cafe%2C_Islington_-_geograph.org.uk_-_453902.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c7/Set_breakfast_%281%29_-_Caf%C3%A9_Belchers.jpg/500px-Set_breakfast_%281%29_-_Caf%C3%A9_Belchers.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c7/Set_breakfast_%281%29_-_Caf